# Contrarian known-ROM database.
# payload-sha1 | title | region | tv | mapper | crt | crop | note
#
# payload-sha1 is SHA-1 of the ROM with its iNES header stripped, so header dirt
# and re-zipping never change a ROM's identity.
#
# region is display only. tv drives fceumm's timing per entry and is never a
# global setting: Probotector is a PAL build and runs subtly wrong for its whole
# duration at 60Hz. USA and JAPAN are both NTSC but must still read differently.
#
# crt is the per-ROM shader answer, written back when Y is pressed. Default is
# OFF: on a 3.2" panel the scanlines cost more legibility than they buy. The
# shader is still shipped and one button away.
# crop is per-ROM overscan, default off.
979494e7869ac7ab4815fdbd1dc99f893f713fbf|CONTRA|USA|NTSC|2|0|0|CHR-RAM
be9dd65be8db897978dd34533dd3a037784a8ee9|CONTRA|JAPAN|NTSC|23|0|0|VRC2b, animated cutscenes
999aca2dfdbdcc164ddab12282290247f4ce21e1|PROBOTECTOR|EUROPE|PAL|2|0|0|robots, 50Hz
